WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.467
Installing REau, step by step

2
00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:09.400
1. Download the APK from the project’s Releases page and open the file to install it

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.800
If Play Protect warns that it blocked the app, tap the button at the bottom, Got it

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:24.067
To install anyway, in the Play Store tap your profile picture, Play Protect and the gear. Pause scanning, install the APK and turn Play Protect back on

5
00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:29.933
2. Open REau and scroll the terms of use to the end, or tap Scroll to the end

6
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.667
Then tap I accept

7
00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:39.200
3. Allow location while using the app. It is only used to find the dash’s Wi-Fi

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.267
If Android asks, also allow the suggested Wi-Fi networks

9
00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:47.133
4. Tap Turn on

10
00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:50.933
Allow notifications: tap Allow

11
00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:58.133
5. The Android Auto server is turned on by hand: tap Open Android Auto settings

12
00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:02.667
The first time, scroll to the bottom and tap Version ten times

13
00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:07.800
Enable development settings appears. Tap OK

14
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.333
Now tap the three dots at the top of the screen

15
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:15.200
Tap Start head unit server

16
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:21.867
Developer mode is only the first time. After that, each time, the three-dot menu is enough

17
00:01:21.867 --> 00:01:29.133
6. Go back to REau. The first time, Android asks Connect to device: tap Connect

18
00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:33.133
REau joins the dash’s Wi-Fi and shows Connecting

19
00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:38.133
With Android Auto Active and the dash Ready, REau is Streaming

20
00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:42.133
7. On the home screen, tap Permissions

21
00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.867
Tap Ask for the missing ones

22
00:01:44.867 --> 00:01:49.733
Android asks about the microphone: tap While using the app

23
00:01:49.733 --> 00:01:52.867
And about calls: tap Allow

24
00:01:52.867 --> 00:02:00.000
8. So Android doesn’t pause the app with the screen off, tap Exclude REau from optimization

25
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.467
In Android’s prompt, tap Allow

26
00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:07.867
9. On the home screen, tap Android Auto screen

27
00:02:07.867 --> 00:02:15.533
The Fit assistant checks that the maneuver arrow and the speed show whole on the dash. Tap Start

28
00:02:15.533 --> 00:02:21.267
All set. Set the route in Waze and put the phone away. To stop, tap Turn off

